  "description": "Cub Plus takes learning to ride to the next level. This balance bike safely teaches tykes the ropes at their own pace by letting them trust their bodies to ride intuitively. It’s got a super narrow frame to accommodate little legs and the lowest possible starting seat height so that even the smallest explorers can ride comfortably. With a limited edition design featuring the iconic Grateful Dead bears and Steal Your Face, this Grateful Dead balance bike will inspire adventures in a whole new generation of fans. Plus, it’s decked out with premium components like wide tires for a smoother ride on all types of terrain, a rust-resistant, low-to-the-ground frame, and an ultra-responsive V-brake with an adjustable pull lever designed especially for little hands to stop the bike confidently.",
